# Hernando de Soto and the Fountain of Youth. Fixture: map_rumour_colonist_outcomes' start with France's de Soto bit
# restored (nations[1].founding_fathers[0] bit 7), the_fountain_of_youth woodcut event bit cleared, RT_RNG LCG state 17.
# FUN_65dd_0004: a Scout with de Soto rolls with skill 3 and bVar4 set, which skips the Fountain's terrain gate
# ((class & 7) > 3, explored > 3) and rerolls Nothing / Vanishes / trespass; a non-Scout explorer gets neither.
key KP_6                   # Seasoned Scout #77 east onto (30,62), mixed forest (class 10, would fail the gate): @LOSTCITY1
wait 30
key Return                 # the Fountain of Youth woodcut
wait 30
key Return                 # eight free recruit picks (FUN_38fd_4884(1,0)); each pick refills its pool slot off the game stream
wait 30
key Down
key Down
key Return                 # pick 1: row 3
wait 30
key Down
key Down
key Return                 # pick 2: row 3, Expert Lumberjacks
wait 30
key Down
key Return                 # pick 3: row 2
wait 30
key Return                 # pick 4: row 1
wait 30
key Return                 # pick 5: row 1, Master Fur Traders
wait 30
key Return                 # picks 6-8: row 1
wait 30
key Return
wait 30
key Return
wait 30
key s                      # sentry the Scout: Preacher #131 is selected
wait 20
key KP_6                   # east onto (39,22): de Soto does not protect a non-Scout, @LOSTCITY5, the unit is despawned
wait 30
key Return                 # colonist #134 is selected
wait 20
key KP_4                   # west onto (36,25): chief's gift 4d10*2 = 50 (@LOSTCITY7), gold 429 -> 479
wait 30
key Return
wait 20
